          "eligibilityDescription_md": "\n1. The applicant should be a farmer. \n1. The applicant should belong to the Scheduled Tribes (ST) category.\n1. The applicant should belong to a Below Poverty Line (BPL) family.\n1. The applicant should be a resident of tribal or forest areas of Gujarat.\n1. The applicant should be a farmer dependent on agriculture as the main source of livelihood.\n1. The applicant should intend to use the machinery for self-employment and agricultural purposes.\n\n<br>\n\n"
        },
